{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport sys\nfrom bisect import bisect_right\n\ndef subset_sums(arr, k):\n    sums = set()\n    for x in arr:\n        x %= k\n        new = {(x + y) % k for y in sums}\n        sums.add(x)\n        sums.update(new)\n    return sums\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n = int(data[0])\n    k = int(data[1])\n    arr = [int(x) % k for x in data[2:2 + n]]\n    if n == 1:\n        print(arr[0])\n        return\n\n    left = subset_sums(arr[:n // 2], k)\n    right = subset_sums(arr[n // 2:], k)\n\n    ls = sorted(left)\n    rs = sorted(right)\n\n    ans = max(ls[-1], rs[-1])\n    for x in ls:\n        idx = bisect_right(rs, k - 1 - x)\n        y = rs[idx - 1] if idx > 0 else rs[-1]\n        ans = max(ans, (x + y) % k, (x + rs[-1]) % k)\n    print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nunordered_set<int> subset_sums(const vector<int>& arr, int k) {\n    unordered_set<int> sums;\n    for (int x : arr) {\n        x %= k;\n        unordered_set<int> new_sums;\n        for (int y : sums) {\n            new_sums.insert((x + y) % k);\n        }\n        sums.insert(x);\n        sums.insert(new_sums.begin(), new_sums.end());\n    }\n    return sums;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(NULL);\n    int n, k;\n    cin >> n >> k;\n    vector<int> arr(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n        cin >> arr[i];\n        arr[i] %= k;\n    }\n    if (n == 1) {\n        cout << arr[0] << '\\n';\n        return 0;\n    }\n    int mid = n / 2;\n    vector<int> left_arr(arr.begin(), arr.begin() + mid);\n    vector<int> right_arr(arr.begin() + mid, arr.end());\n    unordered_set<int> left_set = subset_sums(left_arr, k);\n    unordered_set<int> right_set = subset_sums(right_arr, k);\n    vector<int> ls(left_set.begin(), left_set.end());\n    vector<int> rs(right_set.begin(), right_set.end());\n    sort(ls.begin(), ls.end());\n    sort(rs.begin(), rs.end());\n    int ans = max(ls.back(), rs.back());\n    for (int x : ls) {\n        int target = k - 1 - x;\n        auto it = upper_bound(rs.begin(), rs.end(), target);\n        int idx = it - rs.begin();\n        int y = (idx > 0) ? rs[idx - 1] : rs.back();\n        ans = max(ans, (x + y) % k);\n        ans = max(ans, (x + rs.back()) % k);\n    }\n    cout << ans << '\\n';\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0002244459028588608, -0.001190311275422573, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.0001234931987710297, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -6.97350042173639e-05, -4.887569048150908e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -2.0265558760002023e-06, -0.0002811751910485327, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.2636104656849056e-05, 0.0, -2.861018856492592e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -1.6689160474925302e-05, -8.4638240878121